1
00:00:00,721 --> 00:00:01,721
(Bert:)You just don't want
to go out with me

2
00:00:01,889 --> 00:00:03,889
(Bert:)because I have
an off-putting personality.

3
00:00:04,058 --> 00:00:05,628
(Amy:)No, that's not true.

4
00:00:05,793 --> 00:00:07,793
(Amy:)My boyfriend has
an off-putting personality, too.

5
00:00:07,962 --> 00:00:10,202
(Amy:)Way worse than you.

6
00:00:12,299 --> 00:00:14,469
(Bert:)Don't worry. I'm used to it.

7
00:00:14,635 --> 00:00:17,585
(Bert:)I mean, I'm big and weird
and funny-looking

8
00:00:17,738 --> 00:00:20,448
(Bert:)and no one ever wants
to do anything with me.

9
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:22,821
(Amy:)Don't say that.

10
00:00:23,244 --> 00:00:26,224
(Bert:)It's okay.
I know I'm a monster.

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:28,660
(Amy:)No, Bert, come on.

12
00:00:29,617 --> 00:00:31,327
(Amy:)I'd love to go to the
mineral show with you.

13
00:00:31,485 --> 00:00:34,155
(Bert:)Sweet. It's a date.

14
00:00:37,424 --> 00:00:39,834
(Stuart:)-No, it's not.
Too late!

15
00:00:42,563 --> 00:00:44,973
I (ALTERNATIVE MUSIC PLAYS) I

16
00:00:47,835 --> 00:00:50,075
(Leonard:)Wow.

17
00:00:51,672 --> 00:00:54,082
(Stuart:)Yeah. Haven't seen this
many people in my store

18
00:00:54,241 --> 00:00:57,691
(Stuart:)since that Korean church bus
crashed through my front window.

19
00:00:58,779 --> 00:01:01,419
-Hey! Stuart!
-Jesse.

